          </paramlist><![CDATA[Project: Generic EMT Modeling of Data Center Load v0 (DC_EMTv0)
Authors: Xingyu Zhao, Yingyi Tang & Junbo Zhao
Affiliation: Dartmouth College
Last Updated: 10/27/2026.
Introduction: This project develops a modular EMT simulation model of data center loads supplied by a centralized UPS for power system studies. The model is suitable for studying  control interactions among power electronic modules and dynamic interactions between the data center and the grid. 
Contact: xingyu.zhao.th@dartmouth.edu]]></Sticky>
